@startuml SEQ_14_MELIHAT_DAFTAR_PROKER
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam TitleFontSize 14
title Sequence Diagram — SEQ-14: Melihat Daftar Proker (View-Only)

actor       "Dosen / Kadep"    as Actor
boundary    "Browser"          as Browser
control     "ProkerController" as Controller
entity      "Proker Model"     as Model

== Melihat Daftar Proker ==

Actor   -> Browser     : Buka menu Proker
Browser --> Actor : response / redirect
Browser -> Controller  : GET /proker
Controller --> Browser : response / redirect
Controller -> Model    : Query semua proker
Model --> Controller   : Data proker
Controller --> Browser : Render halaman proker (view-only)
Browser --> Actor      : Daftar proker + tombol "Lihat Detail" saja

== Melihat Detail Proker ==

Actor   -> Browser     : Klik "Lihat Detail" pada salah satu proker
Browser --> Actor : response / redirect
Browser -> Controller  : GET /proker/{id}
Controller --> Browser : response / redirect
Controller -> Model    : Query detail proker
Model --> Controller   : Data proker
Controller --> Browser : Render halaman detail proker (view-only)
Browser --> Actor      : Detail proker: status, dokumentasi, evaluasi, parameter penilaian

@enduml